# Whitelist: ignore everything at the Honours root by default, and only
# allow the three project folders (and this file) into the repository.
# Anything else added to this Honours folder in future stays invisible to
# git, even via a careless `git add .` from the root.
/*
!/Entangle_Magic/
!/2slaterforclaude/
!/TDDMclaude/
!/.gitignore

# junk and per-machine files within the whitelisted folders
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
/2slaterforclaude/.claude/
/2slaterforclaude/.vscode/
/TDDMclaude/*.bak
/TDDMclaude/*.bak2
/TDDMclaude/*.bak3
/TDDMclaude/*.premerge*
